# Blog static mirror (6.8GB — too large for git, use rsync)
blog/blog.p2pfoundation.net/

# Diigo export (278MB, mbauwens.jsonl alone is 79MB - too large for git)
# Untracked and unignored since May 2026, so any `git add -A` tried to commit it.
diigo/

# Runtime data
data/

# Environment
.env

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
mail.env
smtp-password
standby-accounts.txt

# The batch-review data files are SOURCE, not a wiki dump. The bare `data/`
# rule above matches at every level, so it was silently excluding
# infra/p2pwiki/batch-review/data/ — families.php and vocab.php have never been
# committed, and a fresh clone would deploy a tool whose generators fatal on a
# missing require. Un-ignore that one directory.
!infra/p2pwiki/batch-review/data/
